  "story": {
    "title": "Rainbow Girls",
    "paragraphs_en": [
      "Tell me, are all girls the same? Should all girls be the same? It would be boring if they were.",
      "Some girls look like this. Some look like that.",
      "Others prance around in shorts. Some wear frocks. Some love long skirts. And some just slip into their father’s kurta.",
      "And some have no hair at all. Some girls have short hair. Some have long hair.",
      "Some girls like to ride anything that moves. A cycle, a horse, even a donkey. Some like to climb trees. Some are happy making dolls and taking care of them.",
      "Some girls love flying kites and some just love playing gilly danda. Some like to sing loudly and some are just happy to hum.",
      "Some like to be outdoors and to run and play. Some girls like to be home and sit on their father’s lap.",
      "But there are others who do not enjoy dressing up, nor do they have the time for it. They are happy in their shabby clothes and flying hair. Some love dressing up.",
      "Girls can be calm. They can also be naughty.",
      "Sometimes they can get very angry and ﻿ SCREAM",
      "Girls are a mix of happy, angry, naughty, fun or quiet.",
      "All children should be what they want to be Because they are all individuals"
    ],
    "sentences": [
      {
        "text_en": "Tell me, are all girls the same?",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_111755/s_000.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Con nói xem, tất cả các bạn gái đều giống nhau à?"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Should all girls be the same?",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_111755/s_001.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Các bạn gái có nên giống nhau hết không?"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "It would be boring if they were.",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_111755/s_002.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Nếu mà giống nhau hết thì sẽ chán lắm."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Some girls look like this.",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_111755/s_003.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Có bạn gái trông thế này."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Some look like that.",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_111755/s_004.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Có bạn lại trông thế kia."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Others prance around in shorts.",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_111755/s_005.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Có bạn thì tung tăng chạy nhảy với quần đùi."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Some wear frocks.",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_111755/s_006.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Có bạn mặc váy xòe."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Some love long skirts.",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_111755/s_007.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Có bạn lại thích váy dài."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "And some just slip into their father’s kurta.",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_111755/s_008.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Và có bạn chỉ cần mặc chiếc áo kurta của bố."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "And some have no hair at all.",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_111755/s_009.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Và có bạn thì không có tóc chút nào."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Some girls have short hair.",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_111755/s_010.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Có bạn gái tóc ngắn."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Some have long hair.",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_111755/s_011.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Có bạn tóc dài."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Some girls like to ride anything that moves.",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_111755/s_012.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Có bạn gái thích cưỡi bất cứ thứ gì di chuyển được."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "A cycle, a horse, even a donkey.",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_111755/s_013.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Một chiếc xe đạp, một con ngựa, thậm chí là một con lừa."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Some like to climb trees.",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_111755/s_014.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Có bạn thích trèo cây."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Some are happy making dolls and taking care of them.",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_111755/s_015.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Có bạn thì vui vẻ làm búp bê và chăm sóc chúng."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Some girls love flying kites and some just love playing gilly danda.",
        "paragraph_index": 5,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_111755/s_016.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Có bạn gái thích thả diều và có bạn lại thích chơi gilly danda."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Some like to sing loudly and some are just happy to hum.",
        "paragraph_index": 5,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_111755/s_017.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Có bạn thích hát thật to và có bạn chỉ vui vẻ ngân nga."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Some like to be outdoors and to run and play.",
        "paragraph_index": 6,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_111755/s_018.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Có bạn thích ra ngoài trời để chạy và chơi."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Some girls like to be home and sit on their father’s lap.",
        "paragraph_index": 6,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_111755/s_019.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Có bạn gái lại thích ở nhà và ngồi trong lòng bố."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "But there are others who do not enjoy dressing up, nor do they have the time for it.",
        "paragraph_index": 7,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_111755/s_020.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Nhưng cũng có những bạn không thích ăn diện, cũng không có thời gian để làm điều đó."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "They are happy in their shabby clothes and flying hair.",
        "paragraph_index": 7,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_111755/s_021.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Các bạn ấy vui vẻ trong bộ quần áo cũ kỹ và mái tóc bay."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Some love dressing up.",
        "paragraph_index": 7,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_111755/s_022.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Có bạn lại rất thích ăn diện."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Girls can be calm.",
        "paragraph_index": 8,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_111755/s_023.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Các bạn gái có thể điềm tĩnh."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "They can also be naughty.",
        "paragraph_index": 8,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_111755/s_024.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Các bạn ấy cũng có thể nghịch ngợm."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Sometimes they can get very angry and ﻿ SCREAM",
        "paragraph_index": 9,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_111755/s_025.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Đôi khi các bạn ấy có thể rất tức giận và HÉT LÊN."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Girls are a mix of happy, angry, naughty, fun or quiet.",
        "paragraph_index": 10,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_111755/s_026.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Các bạn gái là sự pha trộn của vui vẻ, tức giận, nghịch ngợm, vui tính hoặc trầm tính."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "All children should be what they want to be Because they are all individuals",
        "paragraph_index": 11,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_111755/s_027.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Tất cả trẻ em nên là chính mình, bởi vì mỗi bạn là một cá thể riêng biệt."
      }
    ]
  },
